(PATCHWORK - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A two-player puzzle game. Each player sews a quilt on a 9 x 9 board using patches.) Tj T*
(Patches cost buttons \(the currency\) and time. The game ends when both players reach) Tj T*
(the center of the time board.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Each player gets a quilt board and 5 buttons. Put the 33 patches in a circle around) Tj T*
(the time board and the neutral token after the smallest patch.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WHOSE TURN) Tj T*
(The player whose time token is further behind takes the turn. That player may play) Tj T*
(several turns in a row. If both tokens are on the same space, the token on top plays) Tj T*
(first.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Choose one action:) Tj T*
(- Advance: move your time token to the space directly in front of your opponent and) Tj T*
(   take 1 button) Tj T*
(for each space moved.) Tj T*
(- Buy a patch: choose one of the 3 patches in front of the neutral token, pay its) Tj T*
(   button cost, place) Tj T*
(it on your quilt and move your time token by its time cost. The neutral token moves to) Tj T*
(that spot.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
