(PLACING PATCHES) Tj T*
(Patches may be rotated and flipped but must not overlap other patches.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BUTTON INCOME) Tj T*
(When your time token passes a button symbol on the time board, earn as many buttons as) Tj T*
(there are button symbols on the patches of your quilt.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(LEATHER PATCHES) Tj T*
(The first player who passes a leather patch on the time board takes it and places it) Tj T*
(on their quilt immediately. Leather patches are single squares.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BONUS TILE) Tj T*
(The first player to fill a 7 x 7 square on their quilt takes the bonus tile worth 7) Tj T*
(points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCORING) Tj T*
(At the end, each player counts their buttons and loses 2 points for each empty square) Tj T*
(of their quilt. The bonus tile adds 7 points. The highest score wins; on a tie, the) Tj T*
(player who arrived first at the end wins.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
